      "message": "This is called only from `btif_decode_alarm_cb`\n\nIf `btif_a2dp_sink_avk_handle_timer` is exited while `timer_running \u003d\u003d 1`, then `btif_a2dp_sink_avk_handle_timer` will never be called again.\n\nWe must always set `timer_running \u003d 0` in all code paths.",
